    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Once a day QuickBuds sends its platform, its version number (for example \"Android 5.2.1\") and a random install ID to count active users. The ID ties to no device, account or address, and the app sends no earbud data. Reports carry the same ID and are sent only when you send them.</string>
