    <string name="issue_spatial_silent_body">Some owners hear no spatial effect on this model. We do not know yet if the earbuds or the app cause it.</string>
    <string name="issue_hires_no_codec_title">High-quality audio changes nothing</string>
    <string name="issue_hires_no_codec_body">This model supports only SBC and AAC, so the earbuds have no high-quality codec. The switch turns on, but the sound does not change.</string>
